* leung_nmcf_pin_3 -- AnalogGym topology on TSMC12 BSIM-CMG (LEVEL=72)
* Connectivity and mirror ratios are the shipped ones; geometry is re-designed for 0.8 V FinFET.
.subckt leung_nmcf_pin_3 gnda vdda vinn vinp vout
Nm11 VOUT net050 VDDA VDDA psvt_l16_f10 m=16   $ gmf2_PMOS
